WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.520 --> 00:00:06.260
"THAT I AM ONLY LIVING BY MY ILLUSIONS"

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:10.180
"MY NAME IS DON QUIXOTE"

00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:13.080
"I CANNOT DIE"

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:16.900
Sancho?

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:21.340
A giant with arms six miles long!

00:00:21.340 --> 00:00:23.060
She is in terrible danger!

00:00:23.060 --> 00:00:24.340
Hyaah!

00:00:24.860 --> 00:00:26.680
Aaarrgghh!

00:00:27.080 --> 00:00:29.080
Don't move! Just lay still.

00:00:29.120 --> 00:00:31.500
Oh .. I see the love light in your eyes.

00:00:33.840 --> 00:00:35.800
Don Quixote de la Mancha!

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:38.820
I've come to restore the lost age of chivalry!

00:00:38.820 --> 00:00:39.700
Well I wrote that!

00:00:39.740 --> 00:00:40.620
Blasphemy!

00:00:40.720 --> 00:00:43.560
A hand of our God in heaven wrote me.

00:00:43.620 --> 00:00:45.340
Can I read?

00:00:45.340 --> 00:00:47.080
*laughter*

00:00:47.080 --> 00:00:49.100
A peasant like you cannot read!

00:00:49.220 --> 00:00:50.760
I will sound the words

00:00:50.880 --> 00:00:52.100
And you

00:00:52.100 --> 00:00:54.140
can look at the pictures!

00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:56.360
He actually believes he's Don Quixote.

00:00:56.380 --> 00:00:58.060
This is going to be fun!

00:00:59.160 --> 00:00:59.920
He's a saint!

00:01:00.040 --> 00:01:01.080
He's insane!

00:01:01.160 --> 00:01:02.360
Sancho!! Mmmph!!

00:01:02.640 --> 00:01:04.220
Aaahhh!!

00:01:04.240 --> 00:01:04.960
*barking*

00:01:04.960 --> 00:01:05.460
*laughter*

00:01:17.580 --> 00:01:19.120
I am..

00:01:19.160 --> 00:01:21.060
Don Quixote!

00:01:21.860 --> 00:01:23.620
COMING SOON

